title: Domain Fronting via Host Header Mismatch
id: 13ffd837-6fcf-4494-b95e-f90b4b2369bb
status: experimental
description: Detects SNI vs Host header mismatch.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1090/004/
logsource:
  category: proxy
detection:
  selection:
    tls_sni|exists: true
    http_host|exists: true
  filter:
    tls_sni|fieldref: http_host
  condition: selection and not filter
fields:
  - tls_sni
  - http_host
  - src_ip
falsepositives:
  - Some CDNs and multi-tenant hosting legitimately differ
level: high
tags:
  - attack.command_and_control
  - attack.t1090.004
